Sval: Remove Reader View's read-aloud

Reader View stays; its narration goes: the narrate component, its
toolbar controls, styles, icons, strings, prefs and tests. The DOM
security monitor's C++ allowlist of scripts that may set innerHTML still
names its voice picker.

